    <description>Products:
Outgoing Payments - FX Fixed Fee - FWAP1000
Outgoing Payments - Cross Border - FWAP1100
Outgoing Payments - EFT - FWAP1200
Payables SaaS Fee - FWAP-FEE

Auto Calculate Travel Payables product price for different regions. 05/14/2024 Added ByPass to skip validation rules on Opportunity. 05/23/2024 not generate ARR for renewals. Update to make currency conversion and filter by product code; renewals should not generate ARR; use Ship_To_Account__r 07/24/2024. Use Quote_Line_Type__c instead of Opportunity.Type 07/26/2024. BOPI-511 Updated to calculate ARR when Quote Line Type not &apos;Cancellation&apos; or &apos;Renewal&apos;. BOPI-603 updated to set ARR to 0 for cancelled lines. BOPI-620 updated to set the ARR for cancelled lines to the original amount as a negative value

5/4/2026 SALDEV-1203 Add in new decision criteria to only calculate ARR if Quote Line Type = New.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Cancelled_ARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Get_Original_Opportunity_Product_Cancellation.Opp_Product_ARR__c} * (-1)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EUPayablesCrossBorderARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>25 * {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Client_Home_CCY_XB_PYMNTS__c} * 0.75</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EUPayablesCrossBorderRevenueText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;EU Payables Cross Border - utilization rate: 75% - &quot; + &quot;Autocalculated: $&quot; + TEXT({!EUPayablesCrossBorderARR}) + &quot; - Calculated: &quot; + TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EUPayablesEFTARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.DOM_Outgoing_PYMTS__c} * 3 * 0.75</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EUPayablesEFTRevenueText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;EU Payables EFT - utilization rate: 75% - &quot; + &quot;Autocalculated: $&quot; + TEXT({!EUPayablesEFTARR}) + &quot; - Calculated: &quot; + TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EUPayablesFixedFeeARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>(
    (({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Avg_FX_Trans_Amt__c}  / {!ConversionRate}) * 0.02) 
    * {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.FX_XB_Outgoing_PYMTS__c}
) * 0.75</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EUPayablesFixedFeeRevenueText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;EU Payables Fixed Fee - utilization rate: 75% - &quot; + &quot;Autocalculated: $&quot; + TEXT({!EUPayablesFixedFeeARR}) + &quot; - Calculated: &quot; + TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EUPayablesSaaSFeeRevenueText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;EU - Payables SaaS Fee - $&quot; + TEXT({!$Record.UnitPrice} / {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c}) 
+ &quot; / &quot; + &quot;FX rate: &quot; + TEXT({!ConversionRate}) + 
&quot; Calculated: &quot;+ TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EUPayablesSaasFeeUnitPrice</name>
        <dataType>Currency</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.UnitPrice}/ {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c} / {!ConversionRate}</expression>
        <scale>18</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Renewals shouldn&apos;t generate ARR</description>
        <name>RenewalRevenueText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Renewal Calculated: &quot; + TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
